# gnuboy on the WHY2025 badge: what the keypad does (sdapps/README.md).
# The symbol keys reach Linux as F1..F6: f1 = square, f2 = triangle,
# f3 = cross, f4 = circle, f5 = cloud, f6 = diamond. Esc (the pause
# screen: save and load the state there) and f6 (the keys) are handled in
# badge.c and never reach gnuboy. f5 is kept for settings.

bind up +up
bind down +down
bind left +left
bind right +right
bind f1 +a
bind enter +a
bind f2 +b
bind backspace +b
bind f3 +start
bind x +start
bind f4 +select
bind o +select
